  "bio": "Cristina Feito is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in the fineline style, working out of the renowned El Gordo Tattoo Shop in Oviedo, Spain. Her precision and attention to detail ensure each piece of body art is a delicate, intricate masterpiece. Clients can book an appointment with Cristina through WhatsApp, experiencing both her exceptional talent and professionalism firsthand.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Oviedo, Principality Of Asturias, Spain"
